	"description": "More than 153 tools in one accessible add-on: an AI chat with 26 providers, Gemini voices text to speech, a Gemini Live Assistant you can talk to and share your screen with, 70 advanced AI tools (writing, email, study, code, analysis and daily life), alarm manager, timer, stopwatch, world clock, currency converter, weather, prayer times, news, 44 internet tools (a very advanced website inspector for security, certificate, speed, DNS and email checks, translator, food nutrition lookup, postal codes, anime search, NASA picture of the day, space station, trivia, recipes, GitHub, DNS, speed test and more), 100 alarm sounds with a ring time of your choice, sound effects (enter and exit sounds for the menu) and many offline calculators. Combo boxes give ready-made lists so you do not have to type and cannot make typing mistakes. Every result opens in a dialog. Set the AI provider, model and API key in NVDA settings, My assistant category, where you also find About and tutorials. Open the tools list with NVDA+Shift+A, then type in the search box to find a tool even with spelling mistakes.",
